# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# D.Lab · environment template
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in real values.
# Never commit the real `.env`.
# Vars prefixed `PUBLIC_` are exposed to the browser (Astro/Vite convention).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Formspree form ID for the contact page at /contato.
# OPTIONAL — the production form ID is hardcoded in src/pages/contato.astro
# as a fallback, so the form works out of the box. Only set this var if
# you need to override it (e.g. a staging form with separate notifications).
# Where to find it: https://formspree.io/forms → click your form →
# endpoint looks like https://formspree.io/f/xrgjvqkw (the `xrgjvqkw` is the ID).
# PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_ID=xxxxxxxx
